msgctxt "136"
msgid "Hey! You there!"
msgstr "Ehi, tu!"

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Can I help you?"
msgstr "Posso aiutarla?"

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Is it true that Kazuki-kun, the owner of Stardust, was shot? I heard he's in"
" the hospital!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I can't even eat, I've been so worried! I must've lost at least 30 kilograms"
" since I heard the news!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "(So there's a rumor that Kazuki was shot...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Yeah, it's true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Oh no! I can't bear to think of his beautiful face being injured in any way!"
" I think I'm gonna faint..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Well, actually, his face is fine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Oh, really? Phew..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Knowing Kazuki-kun, I'm sure he put his life on the line to save the club "
"from some nasty yakuza or something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I really should go pay him a visit at the hospital. Wait... Is there even "
"one nearby?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "It's just a rumor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Oh, really? Phew..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Then, why hasn't he been at the club lately? You don't think he's been "
"fired, do you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Not unless he fired himself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "No? Then, what happened!? I'm freaking out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Yeah, it's true."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "It's just a rumor."
msgstr ""

